{"id":1146,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>2025年3月20日，‌体育学院‌开展了‌2025届毕业生就业去向系统培训会暨就业动员大会‌。会议由辅导员李佳怿主讲，全体2025届毕业生参会。‌</p><p>培训会上，李老师围绕‌“全国高校毕业生就业去向登记系统”‌的操作流程、填报规范及注意事项展开详细讲解，重点解读了就业协议签订、档案转递、就业信息确认等关键环节，帮助毕业生熟悉系统操作、规避常见问题。此外，李老师强调了就业的重要性，鼓励毕业生树立正确择业观，主动把握机遇，先就业、再择业，将个人理想融入国家体育事业发展大局。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KUmvOsLmVfU4UDLxNC4UNC8M49bnRWJRLznVUmLiUzN8nml0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfokhRnkyaol-bUlW2Ul-iMNLYMN-8ozl8MzLaLmUbnm6FU47ZMlL4MlWFLzAkMNlJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474L4vsgtA8pU0cc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13377&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DA8CD09B9ABFAB56C26B4954530249F7/C185C35B/18B6E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KL7WOkM47ZM7lbnxmWkn77PM7l4M4lJaUl-4olVknlVfn7l0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7okyPLkyZUz9Zoz-8ozn7MRVfoRvbnmNDUln2Lllsnm6Fn77aMmQfLRrFMRGZUzvDgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4LsMYbw6208c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13377&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KUNWO7L4QVMzL8nxzfkM7LaMzVkMRWJVLNUbnzGDUzU8L8U0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8MkyZUSy8Ll-YM7nRU4lYnl-8M4UioRUYLzW2Uzv8MmQFnNnRMlrVMNVFLz98L7-Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474L4vsgtA8pU0cc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13377&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7448A41B24DCC52EB474584212FA7466/FDC5EE6A/1840B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KUz9O4MR-snzNPLx7-ZMRVRUN7YMmrJVnN-ZLRfRLlV7MNL0gihFp2hmCIa0okh2Lky8LYyYMz7ZUNWVozC8Ul-YM7LPM4MkMR7YU4-PU8rFU47ZM8-4o7QFMRf2ozligtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4LsMYbw6208c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13377&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KUmvOsLmVfU4UDLxNC4UNC8M49bnRWJRLznVUmLiUzN8nml0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfokhRnkyaol-bUlW2Ul-iMNLYMN-8ozl8MzLaLmUbnm6FU47ZMlL4MlWFLzAkMNlJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474L4vsgtA8pU0cc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=13377&e=.jpg"}